<tbody>
<tr>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Item</th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Capabilities&nbsp;</th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Current Status</th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Completion Date</th>
<th class=3D"confluenceTh">Comments</th>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">1</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Client Onboarding to IdentityGraph new stack ser=
vices.&nbsp;</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>In Progress</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p><br></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>This is a multi-phase deliverable.&nbsp; We a=
re currently working to onboard 9 clients in PI19.&nbsp; Application-level =
detail for endpoint onboarding can be found <a href=3D"https://att.sharepoi=
nt.com/:x:/r/sites/MPSYSSuiteInternalCollaborationZone/Shared%20Documents/G=
eneral/Modernization/IDGraph%20Endpoint%20Onboarding%20Progress.xlsx?d=3Dwd=
1119c3ec7184b0fb4ddc1e2d11f2601&amp;csf=3D1&amp;web=3D1&amp;e=3D2tzJhw" cla=
ss=3D"external-link" rel=3D"nofollow">here</a>.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">2</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Onboard MPS-LDAP clients to CG</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>In-progress&nbsp;</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>PI25</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>CG API development to vend MPS-LDAP data is c=
omplete.</p><p>Complete: UVP</p><p>In-progress: HaloC, UNS</p><p>Pending:&n=
bsp; ESSD, MyATT, TVAM, BLS CoreServices, DTV UPS, ISAAC, RTTP</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">3</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>MPSYS CDP mS migration to IDGraph mS.&nbsp;</=
p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">Complete&nbsp;</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">PI24</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>All the 38 MPSYS CDP mS endpoints are migrate=
d to IDGraph.&nbsp;</p><p>Clients onboarding to IDGraph mS:&nbsp;</p><p>Com=
plete:&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>In-progress:&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">4</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Migrate authorization functionality from Orac=
le to Cosmos DB</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">In-progress&nbsp;</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">PI24</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p><a href=3D"https://wiki.web.att.com/display/D=
RC/PasscodeValidation" rel=3D"nofollow">PasscodeValidation - Consumer Techn=
ology eXperience - tWiki</a></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">5</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Migrate One Time PIN (OTP) functionality from=
 Oracle to Cosmos DB</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">In-progress&nbsp;</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">PI25</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p><a href=3D"https://wiki.web.att.com/display/D=
RC/OTP+Database+Migration" rel=3D"nofollow">OTP Database Migration - Consum=
er Technology eXperience - tWiki</a></p></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">6</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>Migrate IBM MQ and Async message processing t=
o AEH and azure consumer mS event processing&nbsp;</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd">In-progress&nbsp;</td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color: rgb(0,0,0);">PI25-26</span=
></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p><a href=3D"https://wiki.web.att.com/display/D=
