</tr>
<tr>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p>7</p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p><span style=3D"color: rgb(0,0,0);">Continue t=
o migrate MPSYS SOAP APIs to IDGRaph MS&nbsp;</span></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p><span style=3D"color: rgb(0,0,0);">In-progres=
s</span></p></td>
<td class=3D"confluenceTd"><p><span style=3D"color: rgb(0,0,0);">PI25-26</s=
